⚠️ Disclaimer
This is a practice / educational project — not intended for production
or enterprise deployment. It runs entirely on CPU + Gemini API (no GPU
required), making it accessible for learning purposes.

The goal is to demonstrate how modern agentic patterns (HTN, LangGraph, MCP,
Vector Memory) can be combined into a coherent autonomous planning system.

