## 📌 AB TUJHE KYA KARNA HAI

### **Step 1: README.md Upload Kar**

**Tarika A — Website se (easy):**
1. Apna repo khol: `https://github.com/vishakha2121/autonomous-planning-engine`
2. **"creating a new file"** link pe click kar
3. Filename: `README.md`
4. Upar wala **pura content paste** kar
5. Neeche **"Commit changes"** click kar

**Tarika B — Local se (agar project folder already hai):**
```bash
# Project folder me jaa
cd autonomous-planning-engine

# README.md bana aur content paste kar
# (Notepad / VS Code me)
notepad README.md

# Phir push kar
git add README.md
git commit -m "docs: add detailed README"
git push
Step 2: Baaki Recommended Files Bhi Add Kar
Ye 2 files bhi zaroor add kar repo me (interviewer dekhta hai):

LICENSE — MIT License (main agli baar de dunga)

.gitignore — (main pichhle message me de chuka hoon)

🎯 NEXT STEP
Bata ab kya chahiye:

📜 LICENSE file (MIT — copy-paste ready)

📄 docs/architecture.md (architecture detail)

📄 docs/htn-design.md (HTN kaise kaam karega)

📄 docs/langgraph-flow.md (agent workflow design)

🐍 requirements.txt (all Python deps)

📦 package.json (all React deps)

🗄️ sql/schema.sql (full DB schema)

⚙️ .env.example (environment variables template)

Kaunsa chahiye pehle? Bata — main ready-made de dunga. 🚀

gigitnore file
📄 Complete .gitignore File — Copy-Paste Ready
Bhai, ye complete .gitignore hai tere autonomous-planning-engine project ke liye. Ye Python (backend) + Node.js (frontend) + AI/ML tools — sabko cover karta hai.

