🎯 Is File Me Kya-Kya Covered Hai (Breakdown)
Category	Kya Ignore Hoga	Kyun
Python	__pycache__/, .pyc, .egg-info	Auto-generated
Virtual ENV	.venv/, venv/	Local machine specific
Env Files	.env, *.key, secrets/	🔒 Sensitive — API keys
Node.js	node_modules/, dist/	Huge size, auto-install
Database	*.db, *.sqlite3	Local data only
ChromaDB	data/chroma/	Local vector store
AI Models	*.pt, *.pth, *.safetensors	Big files
Logs	*.log, logs/	Runtime generated
IDE	.vscode/, .idea/	Personal settings
OS Files	.DS_Store, Thumbs.db	OS-generated junk


