⚠️ ZAROORI BAAT — .gitkeep Files
Git khaali folder upload nahi karta. Isliye jinke andar files nahi hain (jaise data/, data/chroma/, data/uploads/) — unme ek .gitkeep file rakhni padegi.

Ye files bana:

bash
# Backend me ye folders banao aur .gitkeep daalo
mkdir -p backend/data
mkdir -p backend/data/chroma
mkdir -p backend/data/uploads

# .gitkeep files create kar
type nul > backend/data/.gitkeep
type nul > backend/data/chroma/.gitkeep
type nul > backend/data/uploads/.gitkeep
Mac/Linux pe:

bash
mkdir -p backend/data/chroma backend/data/uploads
touch backend/data/.gitkeep
touch backend/data/chroma/.gitkeep
touch backend/data/uploads/.gitkeep
Fir .gitkeep file khaali rahegi — bas GitHub ko folder dikhane ke liye hai.

📌 .gitkeep Ka Syntax Note
.gitkeep ek convention hai (Git ki official feature nahi). Kuch log .keep ya placeholder.txt bhi use karte hain. Koi bhi khaali file chalegi. .gitkeep sabse common hai.

🚀 AB TUJHE KYA KARNA HAI
Step 1: .gitignore File Banao
Tarika A — Website se:

Repo khol: https://github.com/vishakha2121/autonomous-planning-engine

"creating a new file" pe click kar

Filename: .gitignore

Upar wala content paste kar

Commit changes click kar

Tarika B — Local se (agar repo clone kiya hai):

bash
cd autonomous-planning-engine
notepad .gitignore    # Windows
# ya
nano .gitignore       # Mac/Linux
Content paste kar → Save → Push:

bash
git add .gitignore
git commit -m "chore: add .gitignore"
git push
Step 2: Verify Kar Ki Kaam Kar Raha Hai
Ek baar .gitignore add hone ke baad, ye command chala:

bash
git status
node_modules, .env, *.db — kuch bhi list me nahi dikhna chahiye. Agar dikh raha hai toh already tracked ho chuka hai — fir ye command chala:

bash
git rm -r --cached .
git add .
git commit -m "chore: apply .gitignore"
git push
Ye Git ko force karega .gitignore rules re-apply karne ke liye.

🎯 AB AGLA KYA CHAHIYE
Bata:

📜 LICENSE file (MIT — copy-paste ready)

⚙️ .env.example (environment variables template)

🐍 requirements.txt (saari Python dependencies)

📦 package.json (saari React dependencies)

🗄️ sql/schema.sql (complete DB schema with 10 tables)

📄 docs/architecture.md (architecture detail doc)

📄 docs/htn-design.md (HTN planner design)

🐳 docker-compose.yml (local dev)

Bata kaunsa chahiye — main ready-made de dunga, tu bas copy-paste karke push kar de. 🚀



