Bhai, ye complete .gitignore hai tere autonomous-planning-engine project ke liye. Ye Python (backend) + Node.js (frontend) + AI/ML tools — sabko cover karta hai.

✅ .gitignore Full Content
gitignore
# ==========================================
# AUTONOMOUS PLANNING ENGINE — .gitignore
# ==========================================

# ------------------------------------------
# Python
# ------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
.Python
build/
develop-eggs/
dist/
downloads/
eggs/
.eggs/
lib/
lib64/
parts/
sdist/
var/
wheels/
*.egg-info/
.installed.cfg
*.egg
MANIFEST

# Virtual environments
.venv/
venv/
ENV/
env/
.venv*/
pyvenv.cfg
.python-version

# Pytest / Coverage
.pytest_cache/
.coverage
.coverage.*
htmlcov/
.tox/
.nox/
coverage.xml
*.cover
.hypothesis/

# Type checkers / Linters
.mypy_cache/
.dmypy.json
dmypy.json
.ruff_cache/
.pytype/

# Jupyter Notebooks
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# ------------------------------------------
# Environment Variables & Secrets
# ------------------------------------------
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
*.env
!.env.example
secrets/
*.pem
*.key
credentials.json
service-account.json

# ------------------------------------------
# Node.js / React / Vite
# ------------------------------------------
node_modules/
dist/
dist-ssr/
build/
.vite/
.cache/
.parcel-cache/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*
.pnpm-debug.log*
.npm/

# Vite build output
frontend/dist/
frontend/build/

# ------------------------------------------
# Database Files
# ------------------------------------------
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.db-journal
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
data/app.db
data/checkpoints.db

# ChromaDB / Vector store
data/chroma/
chroma_db/
chroma/
*.chroma

# Uploads / user content
data/uploads/*
!data/uploads/.gitkeep

# ------------------------------------------
# AI / ML / Model Files
# ------------------------------------------
models/
*.pt
*.pth
*.ckpt
*.safetensors
*.onnx
*.h5
*.pkl
*.pickle
*.joblib
*.bin
embeddings_cache/
.cache/huggingface/
.huggingface/

# ------------------------------------------
# Logs
# ------------------------------------------
*.log
logs/
*.log.*
npm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pytest.log
uvicorn.log

# ------------------------------------------
# IDE / Editor
# ------------------------------------------
.vscode/
!.vscode/extensions.json
!.vscode/settings.json.example
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*.sublime-project
*.sublime-workspace
*.code-workspace
.vim/
.nvim/

# ------------------------------------------
# OS Generated Files
# ------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/
*.lnk

# ------------------------------------------
# Testing / Temporary
# ------------------------------------------
tmp/
temp/
*.tmp
.cache/
scratch/
playground/
*.bak
*.orig
*.rej

# ------------------------------------------
# Docker
# ------------------------------------------
docker-compose.override.yml
.docker/

# ------------------------------------------
# Documentation Build
# ------------------------------------------
site/
docs/_build/
site_build/

# ------------------------------------------
# Project-Specific
# ------------------------------------------
# Keep folder structure but ignore contents
data/*
!data/.gitkeep
!data/uploads/.gitkeep
!data/chroma/.gitkeep

# Backup files
*.backup
*.bkp

# Test execution artifacts
test_output/
test_artifacts/
execution_traces/

# ------------------------------------------
# End of .gitignore
# ------------------------------------------
🎯 Is File Me Kya-Kya Covered Hai (Breakdown)
Category	Kya Ignore Hoga	Kyun
Python	__pycache__/, .pyc, .egg-info	Auto-generated
Virtual ENV	.venv/, venv/	Local machine specific
Env Files	.env, *.key, secrets/	🔒 Sensitive — API keys
Node.js	node_modules/, dist/	Huge size, auto-install
Database	*.db, *.sqlite3	Local data only
ChromaDB	data/chroma/	Local vector store
AI Models	*.pt, *.pth, *.safetensors	Big files
Logs	*.log, logs/	Runtime generated
IDE	.vscode/, .idea/	Personal settings
OS Files	.DS_Store, Thumbs.db	OS-generated junk


